			"notes": "## What's Changed\n#### New Positive Powers\n- Added More Reach (Gain 2 blocks of entity reach)\n- Eye Enhancements (Gain night vision)\n- Trampoline (Jump 35% higher)\n- Quick Learner (Earn 2x more experience)\n#### New Negative Powers\n- Bad Luck (Loot becomes worse)\n- Bad Learner (Earn 2x less experience)\n- Carnivore (Eating plant-based food poisons you)\n- Vegetarian (Eating meat-based food poisons you)\n#### Other Changes\n- Added mutually exclusive powers.\n- Carnivore and Vegetarian are mutually exclusive now.\n- Big and Tiny are mutually exclusive now.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Flipstargamer/power-tokens/compare/v1.0.1...v1.1.0-beta1"
		},
